ajasthan''s history through lights and sound.\nOvernight stay at the hotel in Jaipur.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Jaipur", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": true, "activities": [{"activity_uuid": "c58db54a-9978-b67a-a62f-9d3dc617f1cd", "sort_order": 0, "title": "Hawa Mahal", "description": "Winds whispering tales of royalty.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "8dd160d7-dd83-44df-711e-0ddbe99e2b8d", "sort_order": 1, "title": "City Palace", "description": "Heritage nestled in elegance.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "133fe8c9-1157-8580-69c3-d4f3cde7df00", "sort_order": 2, "title": "Jantar Mantar (Observatory)", "description": "Astronomical precision in ancient art.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "96b4fae7-bb35-7d26-ae72-c00e2ce255ec", "sort_order": 3, "title": "Jal Mahal", "description": "Water-bound serenity amidst history.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "ffc46764-85a7-3635-6354-0eda2f0e47b8", "sort_order": 4, "title": "Amber Fort", "description": "Majestic past echoing grandeur.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "9ab52928-5c49-9931-bcd8-152bfba61915", "sort_order": 5, "title": "Nahargarh Fort & Palaces", "description": "Legends overlooking Jaipur''s glory.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}], "images": [], "internal_notes": "", "client_notes": "", "operations_notes": "", "status": "planned", "completion_pct": 0, "packing_tips": "", "things_to_carry": []}, {"day_uuid": "93a581cb-9381-ca93-0f47-7042b71a1825", "day_number": 3, "day_title": "Jaipur - Ajmer - Pushkar - Jodhpur", "alternate_day_titles": [], "day_subtitle": null, "day_theme": "Heritage", "day_description": "After breakfast, we head towards Jodhpur, with enroute visits to Ajmer and Pushkar, both famous pilgrimage centers. There are so many people come to visit Ajmer and Pushkar as Ajmer is famous for Dargah and Pushkar is famous for Brahma Temple:\nAfter exploring these spiritual sites, we continue our journey to Jodhpur. Check-in at the hotel upon arrival.\nOvernight stay at the hotel in Jodhpur.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Jodhpur", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": true, "activities": [{"activity_uuid": "d18fcc18-7bfc-cd4f-7e16-661504f21c9f", "sort_order": 0, "title": "Dargah of Khwaja Muin-ud-din Chishti at Ajmer", "description": "Spiritual solace in revered devotion.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "f1de2156-f5ee-091d-a817-2dbdb054e584", "sort_order": 1, "title": "Lord Brahma Temple at Pushkar", "description": "Mythical charm amidst sacred waters.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}], "images": [], "internal_notes": "", "client_notes": "", "operations_notes": "", "status": "planned", "completion_pct": 0, "packing_tips": "", "things_to_carry": []}, {"day_uuid": "896a62d4-5257-0e41-3a77-c4c33d463c3f", "day_number": 4, "day_title": "Jodhpur Sightseeing", "alternate_day_titles": [], "day_subtitle": null, "day_theme": "Heritage", "day_description": "Jodhpur, known as the \"Blue City\" for its blue-painted houses, offers a glimpse into Rajasthan''s rich history with majestic forts like Mehrangarh Fort and cultural attractions like Umaid Bhawan Palace Museum. It is a captivating blend of vibrant traditions and architectural splendour set against the Thar Desert backdrop.\nPost breakfast, we will explore the remarkable attractions of the Blue City:\nOvernight stay at the hotel in Jodhpur.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Jodhpur", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": true, "activities": [{"activity_uuid": "8f78ed51-d916-ffda-099a-a5b5ccb2e37c", "sort_order": 0, "title": "Umaid Bhawan Palace Museum", "description": "Royal legacy in architectural splendour.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "937eb77f-b129-e318-c146-f2e52babccb8", "sort_order": 1, "title": "Jaswant Thada", "description": "Marble memorial to valour.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "00855c9a-768b-3515-cb36-1ee276933651", "sort_order": 2, "title": "Mehrangarh Fort", "description": "Citadel of history and bravery.", "start_time": null, "end_time": null, "entry_fee": 0, "guide_required": false}, {"activity_uuid": "ad0ef1d5-4569-e147-5048-69052a7160ef", "sort_order": 3, "title": "Clock Tower & Markets", "description": "Bazaars bustling with cultura